    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d379-a1-a3">

                <pb facs="0612" n="542" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg542"/>

                <head>No. 3.</head>
                <p>I have just received your despatch of to-day, and a copy of one addressed to me
                    at Gaudalajara, on the 21st ultimo. I send Lieutenant Colonel Bibiano Hernandez
                    and Mr. Augustin Caravantes to treat with you about the first.</p>
                <p>I have ordered hostilities to cease on the line of communication with the city,
                    expecting you to do the same along your entire fortified line.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">Independence and liberty ! Headquarters in
                            <placeName>Colima</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1867-02-01">1st of February, 1867</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>RAMON CORONA.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>General <hi rendition="#small-caps">Felipe N. Chacon,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Colima.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
